            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>It is a time of transition in the area of biomarkers. Confusion is rampant, progress immense and the challenges invigorating. Better diagnosis is possible if we progress in a rational way and avoid the chaos so often characteristic of transitions by relying on the science of the discipline to keep us on track.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
